Z||000003||Black88GT||01-03-2001||03:39 PM||||I ordered from them earlier in the summer, they did take a week or so but I got the right stuff and the price could definitely not be beaten.<P>The thing that was weird to me was I ordered about 6 things, and they came in 5 different packages from 3 different places.  I guess they have 3 different wharehouses around the country, one was from Washington (state), one from California, and I forget the other.<P>Keep in mind though with the holiday season everything is super super slow.  I sent a letter, regular plain jane 33 cent letter, and it took just over 2 weeks to get there (out of state).  Also a 3-5 day package shipped to me took 3 weeks.  <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
